# oxfmt formats non-code files (YAML / JSON / Markdown). Exclude files that are
# generated, vendored, or owned by another tool — reformatting them creates
# churn or breaks downstream tooling.
#
# CRITICAL: changelog files are owned by release-please / git-cliff. If oxfmt
# reformats them, the next regeneration conflicts and CI fmt-check falsely fails
# on every PR between releases. Always exclude them.

# Vendored / generated code
vendor/
*.pb.go

# 远程访问协议的测试向量：vectors.json 由 TestVectors 生成并逐字节核对，noise_ik_vectors.json 摘自公开测试向量，内容不改
internal/remote/testdata/

# Release-please-owned metadata — DO NOT reformat
changelog/
CHANGELOG.md
.release-please-manifest.json
release-please-config.json
.github/scaffold.json

# Lockfiles
**/buf.lock
Cargo.lock
apps/mobile/pubspec.lock

# 手机 App：生成的代码与文案（tool/gen_api.sh、tool/strings.py 生成，CI 检查漂移），Xcode 管的 iOS 工程
apps/mobile/packages/ptt_api/
apps/mobile/lib/l10n/
apps/mobile/ios/

# Build output
dist/
build/
bin/
target/

# Agent 自有的持久状态（Zuno 会重写 RULES.md 与 reports）。
# 若让 oxfmt 格式化它们，每次记忆或报告更新都会让 fmt-check 抖动。
.zuno/
